t\": \"Andrew Worster has worked as a researcher at the McMaster University Faculty of Health Sciences, a renowned medical school in Canada.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"This faculty is known for its excellence in medical education, research, and patient care.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Worster's work at the faculty has contributed significantly to the advancement of medical knowledge and practice.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Evidence of Association\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Multiple credible sources confirm Andrew Worster's association with the McMaster University Faculty of Health Sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"According to his profile on the McMaster University website, Worster is listed as a faculty member at the Department of Medicine, Faculty of Health Sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"[1] Additionally, several research papers and publications co-authored by Worster have been affiliated with the McMaster University Faculty of Health Sciences, further substantiating his connection to the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"[2][3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"References:\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"[1] McMaster University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"Faculty Profile: Andrew Worster.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/fhs.mcmaster.ca\\\\/medicine\\\\/faculty_member\\\\/worster_andrew\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"[2] Worster, A., & et al.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"(2018).\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"Diagnostic accuracy of emergency department clinical decisions regarding admission or discharge of patients with acute chest pain.\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"CJEM, 20(3), 341-348.\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"doi: 10.1017\\\\/cem.2017.436\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"[3] Worster, A., & et al.\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"(2020).\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\", \"text\": \"The McMaster Ac